cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Relict: A Reproducible Environmental DNA Analysis Platform with Conservation Cross-Referencing"
abstract: >
  Relict is an open-source, reproducible platform for environmental
  DNA analysis. It unifies a standard amplicon bioinformatics pipeline
  (fastp → vsearch UNOISE3 with de novo chimera removal → SILVA/MIDORI2 →
  scikit-bio), automated conservation-status cross-referencing (GBIF + IUCN
  Red List), Ed25519-signed reproducibility manifests, and citizen-science
  export of DNA-derived occurrences as Darwin Core Archives — all behind a
  single web interface.
